  "title": "🚗 Road Trip to Ülemiste City",
  "date": "2025-10-15T21:00:00.000Z",
  "content": "🚗 Road Trip to Ülemiste City\n\nToday I joined the Road to Ülemiste City — a tour through one of the most innovative business hubs in Tallinn! 💼✨\n\n\n\nWe visited several exciting workplaces, including Playtech 🎮 and Fujitsu 💻.\n\n\n\n\nBut the real highlight of the day wasn’t digital — it was delicious! 🍴\nAt lunch, I had the best meal since coming to Estonia — Roujiamo (肉夹馍), a steamed pancake stuffed with grilled BBQ meat. 🔥 absolutely perfect. 😋",
